</div>
<div class="component image cf-image-component col-12">


<div class="cf-figure" >
    <figure>
     
            
                <a class="anchor" name=fig003 > </a>
                <div class="cf-figure_return link-button__list-group">
                    <a class="link-button__anchor" href=#fig003-ret>
                        <span class="cf-button--anchor cf-button--up">
                            Return to Figure 3 
                        </span>
                    </a>
                </div>
            
        

        
            <figcaption>
                
                The unemployment rate moved down in June but remains well above its peak after the Great Recession
            </figcaption>
        
       <img src="/-/media/project/clevelandfedtenant/clevelandfedsite/collections/speeches/sp-20200805/sp-20200805-img-03-lg.jpg?w=991&hash=7DFD27ABCF4F9928E8745002F3FD18D7" alt="Figure 3. The unemployment rate moved down in June but remains well above its peak after the Great Recession" sizes="(min-width:992px) 800px,991px" srcset="/-/media/project/clevelandfedtenant/clevelandfedsite/collections/speeches/sp-20200805/sp-20200805-img-03-lg.jpg?w=991&amp;hash=7DFD27ABCF4F9928E8745002F3FD18D7 991w,/-/media/project/clevelandfedtenant/clevelandfedsite/collections/speeches/sp-20200805/sp-20200805-img-03-lg.jpg?w=800&amp;hash=328352A59D868BF4853783A2886B3E1B 800w" />
    </figure>

</div>
</div>
<div class="component image cf-image-component col-12">


<div class="cf-figure" >
    <figure>
     
            
                <a class="anchor" name=fig004 > </a>
                <div class="cf-figure_return link-button__list-group">
                    <a class="link-button__anchor" href=#fig004-ret>
                        <span class="cf-button--anchor cf-button--up">
                            Return to Figure 4 
                        </span>
                    </a>
                </div>
            
        

        
            <figcaption>
                
                In May and June, the economy regained about 1/3 of the job losses in March and April
            </figcaption>
        
       <img src="/-/media/project/clevelandfedtenant/clevelandfedsite/collections/speeches/sp-20200805/sp-20200805-img-04-lg.jpg?w=991&hash=3519C17F37DE6224445CD947FDD0ABBF" alt="Figure 4. In May and June, the economy regained about 1/3 of the job losses in March and April" sizes="(min-width:992px) 800px,991px" srcset="/-/media/project/clevelandfedtenant/clevelandfedsite/collections/speeches/sp-20200805/sp-20200805-img-04-lg.jpg?w=991&amp;hash=3519C17F37DE6224445CD947FDD0ABBF 991w,/-/media/project/clevelandfedtenant/clevelandfedsite/collections/speeches/sp-20200805/sp-20200805-img-04-lg.jpg?w=800&amp;hash=DD91D7FB3F6C6D1FCD04766BBC26197C 800w" />
    </figure>

</div>
</div>
<div class="component image cf-image-component col-12">


<div class="cf-figure" >
    <figure>
     
            
                <a class="anchor" name=fig005 > </a>
                <div class="cf-figure_return link-button__list-group">
                    <a class="link-button__anchor" href=#fig005-ret>
                        <span class="cf-button--anchor cf-button--up">
                            Return to Figure 5 
                        </span>
                    </a>
                </div>
            
        

        
            <figcaption>
                
                Jobs lost in March and April were nearly the same number added over the 10+ year expansion; we are still down about 6 years’ worth of job growth
            </figcaption>
        
       <img src="/-/media/project/clevelandfedtenant/clevelandfedsite/collections/speeches/sp-20200805/sp-20200805-img-05-lg.jpg?w=991&hash=EF44ED72B0173BC1CEF9CD22BF9DE4B3" alt="Figure 5. Jobs lost in March and April were nearly the same number added over the 10+ year expansion; we are still down about 6 years&#39; worth of job growth" sizes="(min-width:992px) 800px,991px" srcset="/-/media/project/clevelandfedtenant/clevelandfedsite/collections/speeches/sp-20200805/sp-20200805-img-05-lg.jpg?w=991&amp;hash=EF44ED72B0173BC1CEF9CD22BF9DE4B3 991w,/-/media/project/clevelandfedtenant/clevelandfedsite/collections/speeches/sp-20200805/sp-20200805-img-05-lg.jpg?w=800&amp;hash=C9A8DA2482B9719EFBA7BF13463DC148 800w" />
    </figure>

</div>
</div>
