                    </a>
                </div>
            
        

        
            <figcaption>
                
                The net increase in the unemployment rate since February is larger for nonwhites than for whites
            </figcaption>
        
       <img src="/-/media/project/clevelandfedtenant/clevelandfedsite/collections/speeches/sp-20200805/sp-20200805-img-06-lg.jpg?w=991&hash=E48D0834ADBE59B1A708DAD5474A78A6" alt="Figure 6. The net increase in the unemployment rate since February is larger for nonwhites than for whites" sizes="(min-width:992px) 800px,991px" srcset="/-/media/project/clevelandfedtenant/clevelandfedsite/collections/speeches/sp-20200805/sp-20200805-img-06-lg.jpg?w=991&amp;hash=E48D0834ADBE59B1A708DAD5474A78A6 991w,/-/media/project/clevelandfedtenant/clevelandfedsite/collections/speeches/sp-20200805/sp-20200805-img-06-lg.jpg?w=800&amp;hash=999D0339CE1484CF9E92AF55DCC61387 800w" />
