            </figcaption>
        
       <img src="/-/media/project/clevelandfedtenant/clevelandfedsite/collections/speeches/sp-20200805/sp-20200805-img-07-lg.jpg?w=991&hash=A6B927A4C1E56494E02B86F2C973DC04" alt="Figure 7. Income and net worth rise with educational attainment" sizes="(min-width:992px) 800px,991px" srcset="/-/media/project/clevelandfedtenant/clevelandfedsite/collections/speeches/sp-20200805/sp-20200805-img-07-lg.jpg?w=991&amp;hash=A6B927A4C1E56494E02B86F2C973DC04 991w,/-/media/project/clevelandfedtenant/clevelandfedsite/collections/speeches/sp-20200805/sp-20200805-img-07-lg.jpg?w=800&amp;hash=5222C86BB4281248B192B436F2DB377B 800w" />
